rential tests)\n      - pkg/testutils/ (RunDiffTests, BuildBinary, DiffTest pattern)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/paste/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Extend paste implementation to cover srd027 R4.1-R4.4\n      - path: cmd/paste/paste_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add differential tests for R4.1-R4.4\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd027 R4.1 per the SRD acceptance criteria\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd027 R4.2 per the SRD acceptance criteria\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd027 R4.3 per the SRD acceptance criteria\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd027 R4.4 per the SRD acceptance criteria\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Follow the existing paste implementation style in cmd/paste/main.go -- extend, do not rewrite\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Differential tests use testutils.RunDiffTests comparing against gpaste from Homebrew coreutils\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Reference binary lookup uses exec.LookPath(\\\"gpaste\\\") with t.Skip if not found\"\n      - id: D4\n        text: \"All differential tests set LC_ALL=C in the Env field\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"srd027 R4.1 acceptance criteria pass\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"srd027 R4.2 acceptance criteria pass\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"srd027 R4.3 acceptance criteria pass\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"srd027 R4.4 acceptance criteria pass\"\n      - id: AC5\n        text: \"go build ./cmd/paste/ compiles without errors\"\n      - id: AC6\n        text: \"go test ./cmd/paste/... -count=1 passes (or skips if gpaste not in PATH)\"\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/uniq -- srd028 R1.1-R1.4\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd028-uniq.yaml (full SRD, focus on R1.1-R1.4)\n      - pkg/testutils/ (RunDiffTest